  nonce: f70d  # f70d
  message: "Fixed via merged PR (dev 1e9c339659). Per the ruling: renamed the per-symbol field lines_of_code -> line_span across ~150 sites + schema (the physical span end-start+1, distinct from file-level SLOC), and reconciled profile.languages. Behavioral evidence: (1) Symbol.from_dict back-compat test (test_symbol_from_dict_line_span_legacy_lines_of_code_key) — a pre-rename map {'lines_of_code': 9} deserializes to line_span==9, new key wins when both present; (2) full suite 19775 passed @ 100% cov across all packages after the rename. ir.py field docstring now states physical span (NOT SLOC) and points to profile.languages[*].loc. Schema reconciliation: profile.languages[*] declared phantom {files, lines, percentage} but the producer (LanguageStats.to_dict) only emits {files, loc}; schema now documents the real {files, loc} with loc = file-level SLOC. dead-code-prospector consumer + fixtures + dogfooding playbook updated; docs/schema.json + docs/ARCHITECTURE.md regenerated."  # f70d
